    "title": "2 arrested in connection with burglaries at Glendale pharmacies - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Elizabeth Chavolla ,\n1 days ago\nGlendale police arrested two people suspected of involvement in burglaries at two local pharmacies, according to authorities. The Glendale Police Department said Western Pharmacy was burglarized Aug. 26 and Riley’s Pharmacy on Oct. 11. The arrests followed an investigation that led to the recovery of multiple firearms, stolen narcotics,...\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources\n2",
